Key Shift Between the Two Generations

The primary difference lies in digital integration versus digital immersion. Gen Z remembers adapting to emerging social platforms and uses technology as a tool to find answers independently. Gen Alpha has never known a world without touchscreens, algorithms, and AI, treating technology as an interactive environment that must immediately respond to their input.
